<title>SPAIN: Spain's 1-year bill yield falls to 5.800 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's 1-year bill yield falls to 5.800 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price    Pvs     Bid	Allocated</p>
<p> 1-year     5.800   5.900    94.46    94.37   579.880    421.153</p>
</text>
